{title: Teri Duniya Se Hoke Majboor}
{artist: Kishore Kumar}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Teri duniya se ho,        Ke [D]majaboor [C]chala.. [G]
Main bahot [G]door bahot [D]door,        Bahot [G]door chala
[D]Is kadar door ke phir laut,        Ke bhi [G]aa [D]na sakoo
[D]Ayesi manzil ke jahaan,        Khud ko bhi Main [G]pa [D]na sakoo
[D]Aur majaboori hain kya,        [D]Aur [G]majaboo [D]ri hain kya
[D]Itanaa bhi [G]Batala na sakoo,        [G]Teri duniya se ho
Ke [D]majaboor [C]chala.. [G],        Main bahot [G]door bahot [D]door
Bahot [G]door chala,        [D]Aankh bhar aai Agar ashkon ko
Main [G]pi [D]loonga,        [D]Aah nikali jo kabhi
Hothhon ko main [G]si [D]loonga,        [D]Tuz se wada hain kiya
[D]Tuz se [G]wada [D]hain kiya,        [D]isaliye Main [G]ji loonga
[G]Teri duniya se ho,        Ke [D]majaboor [C]chala.. [G]
Main bahot [G]door bahot [D]door,        Bahot [G]door chala
[D]Khush rahe too hain jahan,        Le jaa duwa [G]yen [D]meri
[D]Teri raahon se juda,        Ho gayi raa [G]hen [D]meri
[D]Kuchh nahin sath mere,        [D]Kuchh nahin [G]sath [D]mere
[D]Bas hain khata [G]yen meri
